      "name": "Scroll Indicator",
      "role": "Small downward-arrow icon below the hero to prompt scrolling",
      "description": "Simple circular outlined icon in Deep Indigo, ~48px diameter, 1.5px stroke, containing a downward-pointing chevron. Centered below the hero text. Minimal — the system doesn't rely on elaborate scroll animations."
